      "writtenOn": "2016-12-12T18:41:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The call returns false when no scorer is active, and we plan to turn off the feature when the recommendation service is not up, so it shouldn\u0027t need to check the boolean.\n\nWhen the broadcast is sent to trigger the score cache to be updated, the following code may not retrieve the updated scores yet, which is fine because the behavior should still pick the best qualified network based on existing scores in the cache.",
      "parentUuid": "3a26a7ad_0d15d75f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 280,
